tions; unknown | green | green | none |\n140|| `internal/clonefidelity` | `ValidReasonCode` | core + reverse-DNS; bad codes | green | green | none |\n141|| `internal/cloneplan` | `BuildProjectionPlan` | valid plan; every invalid class in the clause map | n/a (new) | green | none (new surface, no importer yet) |\n142|| `internal/cloneplan` | `DecodeProjectionPlan` | sealed plan; mutated / hand-built docs | n/a (new) | green | none |\n143|| `internal/cloneplan` | `BuildProjectedObjectManifest` | valid manifest; every invalid class | n/a (new) | green | none |\n144|| `internal/cloneplan` | `DecodeProjectedObjectManifest` | sealed manifest; mutated docs | n/a (new) | green | none |\n145|| `internal/cloneplan` | 5 vocabulary predicates | in-vocabulary; out-of-vocabulary incl. invalid UTF-8 | n/a (new) | green | none |\n146|\n147|## Axis inventory\n148|\n149|- Member census: 13 shapes, 97 members, reflection-derived from\n150|  the Go input types (nested structs, slices of structs, maps;\n151|  4 documented irregular names; synthesized members by sealed set\n152|  difference); per member: unknown/missing (decode), miscased in 6\n153|  variant classes (decode), 5-6 wrong JSON types (decode),\n154|  duplicated (decode, byte-path splicer), zero-value (build),\n155|  5 invalid-UTF-8 classes (both). Bounded: all axes enumerated\n156|  exhaustively. `TestMemberCensusNoLiteralList` guards the\n157|  derivation (trips at 10+ member names, 40%+ purity).\n158|- Identities: 2 ids; independent JCS recompute + wrong-omission\n159|  disagreement + tampered/non-digest refusals.\n160|- DAG: sequences unbounded above (uint53) — structural argument\n161|  (strict decrease forbids cycles; existence is a set lookup;\n162|  locality pinned by AST + 35 single-edge toggles) + every graph\n163|  through 4 ops (2+16+512+65536) vs the oracle through both\n164|  entries + every edge class at every 5-op position (30 probes) +\n165|  all 1024 valid 5-DAGs admit + targeted invalids\n166|  (higher/self